Domain Entity PathMilestone
    documentation "A significant event or achievement as part of a path of study."
    shared string PathMilestoneName
        documentation "The descriptive name of the path milestone."
        is part of identity
    descriptor PathMilestoneType
        documentation "The type of milestone defined for the student's path of study."
        is part of identity
    shared string PathMilestoneCode
        documentation "The code or identifier associated with an element associated with the path milestone."
        is optional
        role name PathMilestoneCode
    shared string Description
        documentation "Additional information describing the path milestone to be achieved."
        is optional
        role name PathMilestone
